```console
$ scherzo-cloud organization member update --help
Update an organization member's role

Usage: scherzo-cloud organization member update [OPTIONS] --role <ROLE> <ORGANIZATION> <MEMBERSHIP>

Arguments:
  <ORGANIZATION>  Organization ID or exact slug
  <MEMBERSHIP>    Membership ID

Options:
      --role <ROLE>                    Set the organization role [possible values: owner, member]
      --json                           Print the organization result as JSON
      --service-api-key-file <PATH|->  Authenticate with a service API key from a private file, or - for standard input
      --allow-insecure-http            Allow this command's Scherzo Cloud requests over insecure HTTP connections
  -h, --help                           Print help

```
